{"id":"deck","lemma":"Deck","pos":"noun","rank":2238,"glosses":["deck (of a ship or boat)"],"ipa":"/dɛk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/34/De-Deck.ogg/De-Deck.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Deckes","plural":"Decks"},"examples":[{"text":"Das Schiff hat drei Decks.","en":"The ship has three decks.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"ship"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"three (numerical value…"},null]},{"text":"Wir gingen an Deck spazieren.","en":"We were walking on the deck.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"at / on"},null,{"g":"to take a walk"}]},{"text":"Ich ging von meiner Kabine an Deck.","en":"I left my cabin and went on deck.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/694697","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"cabin, cubicle"},{"g":"at / on"},null]},{"text":"Die Matrosen tanzten an Deck.","en":"The sailors danced on deck.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"seaman","l":"Matrose"},{"g":"to dance","l":"tanzen"},{"g":"at / on"},null]},{"text":"Deck das Holz mit einer Plane ab!","en":"Cover that lumber with a tarp.","words":[null,{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"wood"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a / one","l":"ein"},{"g":"to plan","l":"planen"},{"g":"beginning at that time…"}]}]}